# Manual requests for an IDE HTTP client. Start the application with DB_* and dev.
# First list accounts, then replace the IDs below with the returned identifiers.
# The optional demo-data.sql script does not guarantee fixed numeric IDs.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sourceAccountId = 1
@destinationAccountId = 2
# Replace with the reference returned by the POST request.
@reference = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Account snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{sourceAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Transfer money (changes balances when executed manually)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": {{sourceAccountId}},
  "destinationAccountId": {{destinationAccountId}},
  "amount": 25.00
}

### Receipt by returned reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{reference}}
Accept: application/json

### Sent and received transfers, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{sourceAccountId}}/transfers
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Swagger UI (follow redirect in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html
